{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match, strategise, and master the board!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mega Deal Card</strong> is a <strong>\u00abroguelike\u00bb\u00a0</strong>card game where forming trios is your best move. In this free demo, you'll dive into its addictive mechanics and get ready for the full challenge.  <br>\u2022 Match cards by number or colour on a 3x3 grid. <br>\u2022 Plan your strategy by acquiring new cards for your deck or modifying them through your skill panel. <br>\u2022 Activate powerful effects with 12 unique special cards (out of 25 in the full game). <br>\u2022 Overcome 3 levels with changing rules and prove your tactical skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916930/extras/6490cbd2be19f32aec5e181ac327dca4.poster.avif?t=1756408073\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916930/extras/6490cbd2be19f32aec5e181ac327dca4.webm?t=1756408073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916930/extras/6490cbd2be19f32aec5e181ac327dca4.mp4?t=1756408073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0 <strong>Demo Limitations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Only the first difficulty level available. <br>\u2022 Perks and special decks are locked.<br>\u2022 Achievements and competitive mode are disabled (unlock them in the full version!).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Why try the demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Simple yet deep mechanics \u2013 easy to learn, tough to master.<br>\u2022 A classic casino-inspired aesthetic with a modern <strong>\u00abroguelike\u00bb\u00a0</strong>twist. <br>\u2022 Fast, replayable runs \u2013 every attempt is a fresh opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916930/extras/74521b0c11825e7d55bb0b25641b9813.poster.avif?t=1756408073\" width=240 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916930/extras/74521b0c11825e7d55bb0b25641b9813.webm?t=1756408073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Ready for more?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it hooks you in (and it will!), don\u2019t forget to add it to your <strong>wishlist</strong> and prepare to play your strongest hand.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916930?t=1756408073","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916930?t=1756408073","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916930/ca7feee142b1f9c658f372685f02237a85923560/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756408073","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916930/ca7feee142b1f9c658f372685f02237a85923560/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756408073","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match, 